# This repository is PUBLIC. Everything below is deliberately withheld because
# it describes private infrastructure, not because it is unimportant.
#
# Before adding an exception here, check what the file actually contains: the
# deploy tooling carries LAN addresses, host names and the layout of a private
# network, and the project notes record known-weak configuration on machines
# that are not this one.

# Deployment: nginx site templates and k8s manifests, full of internal hosts.
deploy/

# Site-specific tooling. scripts/build.sh IS public — it is the whole build and
# has no infrastructure in it. These two do:
scripts/init.sh
scripts/deploy.sh

# Working notes and the original spec: both reference internal hosts and other
# apps on the same fleet.
CLAUDE.md
sounds_spec.md

# Manual test checklists — these are mostly ssh commands with real addresses.
tests/

# Local editor/agent config.
.claude/

# Build output.
dist/

# Raw material. Only the two generated screenshots belong in screenshots/,
# and the 1024px icon source is derived from scripts/icon-source.svg.
screenshots/*
!screenshots/narrow.png
!screenshots/wide.png
icons/icon-source-1024.png

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
